4px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 224px; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Application Begin : <strong>25/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Last Date for Registration: <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>15/06/2024</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice Filling : As Per Schedule</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Seat Allotment&nbsp; &nbsp;: <strong>As per Schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.76%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Registration Fee/-</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">All Candidate : <b>1000/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Online UPI, Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 248.461%; height: 104px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPTAC Admissions 2026:</b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b> Online Counseling</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>UPTAC Admissions 2026 Course List with Exam Name</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">B.Tech (All Branches)<br>\nM.Tech Integrated</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>JEE (Mains)&nbsp; / CUET UG&nbsp;</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>JEE (Mains)&nbsp; / CUET UG&nbsp;</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 51px; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B Arch</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 51px; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>NATA 2025, 2026, JEEMAIN 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B Pharm</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"10\"><strong>CUET UG 2026<br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">Pharm D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">BHMCT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">BFAD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">BFA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MBA Integrated</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MCA Integrated</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">BBA / BMS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">BCA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B. Voc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B.Des</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>UCEED – 2026, JEEMAIN 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B Tech Laterial</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>CUET UG 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">B Pharma Laterial</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>CUET UG 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MBA</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 229.358%;\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"4\"><strong>CUET PG 2026</strong><br>\n<strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong><strong><br>\n</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MBA Lateral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MCA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.103%;\" colspan=\"2\">MCA Lateral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.461%;\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>How to Fill </strong></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPTAC Online Counseling Registration 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Technical Admission The following steps have to be followed for registration in counseling.</li>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Technical Admission 2026 The process of counseling will be in multiple rounds.</li>\n<li>The registration process for the first round will start from <strong>25 May 2026&nbsp; to Course Wise Last Date</strong>.</li>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Technical Admission Counseling 2026 Through B Tech First Year Through <b>JEEMAIN 2026</b>, registration will have to be done in UPTAC counseling and along with the documents will also have to be provided.</li>\n<li>After registration and uploading the documents in Uttar Pradesh Technical Admission Counselling, the candidate will have to pay the registration fee.</li>\n<li>The verification of the candidate’s document will be done by the UPTAC Central Document Verification Team and after the completion of the verification process, the candidate will be informed through SMS / Email.</li>\n<li>After the completion of the verification process, the candidate will have to do online choice filling, in which he will have to select the college and branch of his choice.</li>\n<li>Declaration of UPTAC First Year Seat Allotment Results</li>\n<li>Choose Option / Seat Acceptance (Freeze /Float R1, Freeze/Float R2 &amp; R3, Auto Freeze R4) via Payment of Acceptance Fee.</li>\n<li>Reporting at allotted Institute.</li>\n<li>Candidates who did not get the college will have to check their result in the next round and choice filling will also have to be done according to the round.</li>\n<li>For More Details Must Read the Full UPTAC 2026 Counseling Procedure .</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px; text-align: center; width: 248.461%;\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 248.461%; text-align: center; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"8\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px; text-align: center; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.76%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 248.461%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><strong style=\"font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><a title=\"UPTAC Online Counseling 2026\" href=\"https://uptac.samarth.edu.in/index.php/registration/user-new/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>How to Registration (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 99.76%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><a title=\"UPTAC Registration Kaise Kare\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/mvswf7nx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit;\">Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Candidate Manual</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><b><a title=\"UPTAC\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nFvTaHDT_2AztBER2EQg4-VtyiZgwNr2/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">English</a> | <a title=\"UPTAC Hindi\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FOBq9pBKylmO71rTrDpv10WSSn8P3gjj/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hindi</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Information Brochure</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 99.76%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><a title=\"UPTAC Brochure\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1O4KKcz0bt98x3xEslfxBTAkP1Gz5wa6k/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 62px; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 99.76%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 62px; width: 67.1267%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.76%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><a style=\"font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit;\" title=\"UPTAC Official Website\" href=\"https://uptac.samarth.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>UPTAC Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">1. When did the UPTAC Admissions Online Registration 2026 start?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process for UPTAC Admissions 2026 started on <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"455\">25 May 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. What is the last date to apply online for UPTAC Admissions 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to submit the online application form is <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"634\">Course Wise</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>3. How can I apply for UPTAC Admissions 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_22563\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22563\" style=\"width: 1458px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22563\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201468%20947'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"UPTAC Admissions 2026\" width=\"1468\" height=\"947\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026.png 1468w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026-300x194.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026-1024x661.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026-768x495.png 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1468px) 100vw, 1468px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026.png\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22563\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026.png\" alt=\"UPTAC Admissions 2026\" width=\"1468\" height=\"947\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026.png 1468w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/uptac2026-300x194.png 300w, https://www.s